# N3c-turn: e1m1's first corridor at a run (320 units a second), rendered at 480 frames a
# second, the view turning from yaw 135 to 45 (smoothstep) so the eight 480 Hz frames of
# each 60 fps frame differ. Slop with the status bar and the gun, id's bob.
#
# Assembly: the film shows it twice. For "It's fast", every eighth frame (8k) alone. For
# "Run id's code faster", frame 8k with the eight frames 8k to 8k+7 along its top as
# 235x132 tiles, each a 1:1 crop about the view's centre (960,420), numbered, on a dark
# band, and "480 HZ" below them at the right. The camera's keys are dense (every 1/60 s).

map e1m1

duration 4.1
fps 480
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
bob on
player camera
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 0.0000  480,-352.000,110  0,135.000  ease linear
